	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Spero te omnia, quae superioribus diebus scripsi, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>accepisse te una cum supplicatione amplissi<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>mi senatus nostri pro <persName ref="p293">Beccaria</persName>.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Legi, quae dedisti <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>ad d. <persName ref="p1283">Gessnerum</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Oro dominum, ut c[aus]ae nostrae bene<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>dicat; nisi enim hic vires suas exercuerit, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>difficillimum erit frenum indomito imponere <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>equo.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Magnae sunt vires episcopi; sed maior est virtus <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Christi, qui, si voluerit, nullo negotio bullam <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>hanc difflabit.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Anxie expecto, quid factum <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>sit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Dominus prohibeat seditionem; alioqui enim [<placeName ref="l2448">Quinq<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>uepagicis</placeName>]<note type="misc">gestrichen.</note> amplissimum esset apertum ostium, et multo <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>plus commodi authoritatisque accederet episcopo et adver<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>sariis, quam detractum esset.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Dominum ergo oro, ut ipse haec <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>moderetur; nam quotidie magis magisque experior verum <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>esse, quod dominus dixit: filios huius saeculi prudentiores <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>esse filiis lucis.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Sumus desides, meticulosi, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>intricati et molles.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="de">Wir sind weder dappffer noch <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>ernschafft und beständig in gottes sachen.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Ea res me <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>iam annis aliquot afflixit et nunc tantum non enecat; <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>cogor enim audire et videre quotidie, quae nolim.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Ex<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>perior Ieremiam non frustra post tot exantlatos <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>labores tam vehementer suorum increpasse ignaviam <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>et incredibilem in malo obstinatiam.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Nisi vero dominus <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>haec eventura praedixisset, mirum non esset, si nauclerus <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>clavum abiiceret.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Concilium indixit pontifex; <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>concilium pontificium orno libris hisce meis aeditis; <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>unum exemplar accipe tu, alterum da <persName>Philippo</persName> nostro, <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>tertium mitte d. <persName ref="p8432">Friderycho a Salice</persName> et saluta hos <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>meo nomine quam humanissime.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Quae aliunde accepi, communico <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>hic ea lege, ut remittas.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Memorabilia sunt, <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>quae allata sunt ex <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName>, <placeName ref="l834">Italica</placeName> nulla, nisi <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>quod adventus <placeName ref="l2510">Turcae</placeName> potentissimi et aliunde indicatur.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>Bello ita constringetur <placeName ref="l834">Italia</placeName> cum <placeName ref="l875">Hispania</placeName>, ut non <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>multum videantur contra evangelium effecturi.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Inter <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>viris accipit hostis noster communis; <foreign xml:lang="de">der wirt uns her<lb xml:id="p1z37"/>nach reformieren und das concilium hallten etc.</foreign></s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de">Hütt ist <lb xml:id="p1z38"/><persName>Ioannes Hylerus</persName> fürgeschlagen gen <placeName ref="l108">Davaß</placeName>; morn kumpt <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>es für.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="de"><persName ref="p8016">Thobias Egli</persName> hat nitt gelangen mögen; dann <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>wie er von <placeName ref="l159">Frowenfeld</placeName> vertriben, sorgend nun herren, <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>er werde von <placeName ref="l2448">5 Ortten</placeName> kein ruͦw haben und die uff <placeName ref="l108">Davas</placeName> dar<lb xml:id="p1z42"/>zuͦ plaget werden.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="de">Ir werdent wol verstanden haben <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>von herren burgermeister und herren landtamen uff <placeName ref="l108">Davaß</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>was sy mitt mir gehandlet und wie ernstlich sy eins <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>predicanten begärt.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="de">Dorumb, so min herren inen <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>willfarend, redet mitt inen, daß sy inn eerlich <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>und wol halltind, wie er aller eeren wol wert.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/>Zuͦ imm wirt fürgeschlagen <persName>Ioannes Fäsy</persName>, hälffer <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>zuͦ <placeName>Wäningen</placeName>; mag nitt wüssen, welcher es <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>wirt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="de">Es ist mir der sinn an <persName>Hylerum</persName> nie kummen; <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>aber wie andere herren von imm anhuͦbend zuͦ r[eden], <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>was ich fro; dann ir wüssend, das er redlichs dings und wol gelert ist.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Dominus <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>tecum, frater charissime.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> 31. ianuarii 1561.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Tuus, quem nosti.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Praestantissimo viro d. <persName ref="p8009">Ioanni Fabritio</persName>, <placeName ref="l98">Curiensis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>ecclesiae fideli ministro, domino et <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>fratri suo colendo et dilecto.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Chur.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
